  "notes": "Cash basis. Governmental figures roll fund balance (908,586 -> 1,030,233, p4); no beginning governmental cash printed. ending_cash = cash and cash equivalents + cash with county treasurer (p3); certificates of deposit in ending_investments. Governmental statement lists spending by object only; functions taken from the dominant fund column. Interest income printed under Other Financing Sources below Total Receipts (outside_printed_total). Business-type (Water, Sewer, Solid Waste) rolls cash-basis net position (p6, same figures as the Statement of Activities p2); proprietary cash flows from p7-8. Balance sheet: governmental lines from the governmental funds statement (p3, totals equal the government-wide Governmental column), business-type from p1 Proprietary column; Elwood Care Center component unit excluded throughout (budget schedule p9 Nursing Home lines skipped). Detail: General Fund from the departmental combining statement (p10); the p9 all-funds budget schedule contributes only the Street, CRA, Water, Sewer and Solid Waste spending lines (its revenue lines are not by fund). Read pages 1-10 of 10."
